            "id": "q-1788607908377-gy2qfk",
            "type": "structured",
            "prompt": ". Grade 5 learners took an outdoor activity to identify a site for soil improvement.  \nState three characteristics of a site that requires soil improvement they can identify.\n(3 marks) \n_____________________________________________________________________ \n_____________________________________________________________________\n_____________________________________________________________________",
